# Nothing Phone (3) gpio-keys
# Scancode 250 (0xfa) = Essential Key. Mapped to CAMERA as the transport keycode;
# the MetroidKeyHandler (system_server DeviceKeyHandler) intercepts scanCode 250
# and toggles the torch, consuming the event. Without the handler this falls back
# to a camera-launch key.

key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 250   CAMERA
